KG42.register("clusters-17932dfd49d8c9ba5b580a75",{"id":"18-dlmp_analysis::v142-d-K003","paper":"18-dlmp_analysis","label":"Linear supply-function coordination when price response has multiple solutions","record":{"cluster_id":"v142-d-K003","label":"Linear supply-function coordination when price response has multiple solutions","market_meaning":"When the nodal DLMP published by the DSO may support multiple optimal load schedules and cause network limit violations, the DSO intends to linearly approximate the system supply function around the optimal scheduling level in order to coordinate load response. The existing Rule-Chain preserves the problem conditions and the proposed action; the unique and network-feasible clearing result still lacks complete conditions and a mathematical representation.","mechanism_ids":["v141-a-M02"],"market_types":["DEM"],"process_stages":["coordination","pricing"],"scope_disposition":"conditional","scope_explanation":"This Rule-Cluster is limited to M02 daily-cycle nodal price coordination and its multi-solution correction case, especially involving deferrable load. The correction proposal is not an unconditional step for all price applications; R008 only shares and cites the existing price-application fact.","assembly_status":"partial","boundary_rationale":"Multiple optimal responses and potential limit violations are independent trigger conditions, and the supply-function approximation is a coordination activity addressing that problem. It maintains an interface with conventional day-ahead clearing, but the repeated description of price application is not counted again as an independent rule.","chain_bindings":[{"chain_id":"v141-c-R006","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provide the DSO's proposed supply-function approximation action; its C001 overlaps with the price-application fact in R008 and is treated as a shared representation."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R007","ownership":"primary","role":"core","rationale":"Provide the conditions of multiple optimal responses and potential network limit violations after price publication."},{"chain_id":"v141-c-R008","ownership":"shared","role":"alternative","rationale":"The primary attribution is v142-d-K002; here only its price-application fact is cited as another representation of R006-C001, without increasing the count of independent rules."}],"connections":[{"connection_id":"v142-d-K003-L001","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R007","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","kind":"functional_coupling","from_refs":["v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E007"],"rationale":"The source explicitly takes multiple optimal schedules and potential limit violations as the reason for proposing the supply-function approximation, supporting the assembly of the problem condition and the correction action; this does not serve as a basis for adding a uniqueness proof or graph edges."},{"connection_id":"v142-d-K003-L002","from_chain_id":"v141-c-R006","to_chain_id":"v141-c-R008","kind":"alternative_representation","from_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R006::E::v141-c-R006-E001"],"to_refs":["v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001","v141-c-R008::E::v141-c-R008-E001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E006"],"rationale":"The specified constraints of the two Rule-Chains express the same DSO activity of using the nodal DLMP, whereas the frozen graph adopts opposite directions. Only this part is associated as an alternative representation; the supply-function approximation content of R006 is still retained independently."}],"object_mappings":[{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-O001","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R006::V::coordination.local_operator","v141-c-R008::V::coordination.local_operator"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R008::V::coordination.local_operator","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E006","v141-b-g01-E007"],"rationale":"Both places refer to the DSO that applies nodal prices and undertakes the described coordination activity in M02; the representative selection does not change the primary attribution of the Rule-Chain."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-O002","kind":"same_node","member_refs":["v141-c-R006::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R007::V::pricing.local","v141-c-R008::V::pricing.local"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R008::V::pricing.local","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E006","v141-b-g01-E007"],"rationale":"The three references all point to the nodal DLMP function of the same daily-cycle distribution market, used respectively for price application and its response problem; other price nodes with the same name are not deemed identical across mechanisms."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-O003","kind":"same_expression","member_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C001","v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001"],"canonical_ref":"v141-c-R008::phi::v141-c-R008-C001","display_policy":"single_representative","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E006"],"rationale":"The two procedural constraints agree in subject, nodal-price use, aggregator object and daily-cycle scope. A display representative is selected only for this repeated fact, and all original constraints remain accessible."},{"mapping_id":"v142-d-K003-O004","kind":"alternative_representation","member_refs":["v141-c-R006::E::v141-c-R006-E001","v141-c-R008::E::v141-c-R008-E001"],"canonical_ref":null,"display_policy":"linked_distinct","evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E006"],"rationale":"The two edges represent the same price-application activity in opposite directions and cannot be judged as the same directed edge, nor can bidirectional causality be inferred from the source; both frozen-graph representations are retained."}],"gaps":[{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G001","category":"math_incomplete","description":"The supply function, the linearization point, the specific form of the approximation and the post-correction clearing conditions are all undefined. The text of E007 claims uniqueness and satisfaction of network constraints, but R006-C002 preserves only the approximation action; the existing Rule-Chain cannot verify that result, nor can price uniqueness and schedule uniqueness be conflated.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006","v141-c-R007"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R006::phi::v141-c-R006-C002","v141-c-R007::phi::v141-c-R007-C001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E007"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Additionally submit the supply function under the same mechanism, the optimal scheduling point, the corrected clearing procedure, and the applicable conditions for uniqueness and network feasibility, to be expressed explicitly by C; partial assembly is currently maintained."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G002","category":"ambiguous_mapping","description":"R006-E001 and R008-E001 have opposite directions, while the supporting text only describes the DSO using the DLMP. This is a directional ambiguity in the existing graph representation and does not constitute evidence of feedback or bidirectional dependency.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006","v141-c-R008"],"object_refs":["v141-c-R006::E::v141-c-R006-E001","v141-c-R008::E::v141-c-R008-E001"],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E006"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the edge directions and the meaning of links, and then let upstream decide whether to revise; D retains the linked_distinct alternative relationship."},{"gap_id":"v142-d-K003-G003","category":"unverified_source","description":"Both the price application and the correction proposal are supported only by literature-review excerpts that have not been independently reviewed; the original scheme and its guarantee conditions have not yet been verified.","chain_ids":["v141-c-R006","v141-c-R007","v141-c-R008"],"object_refs":[],"evidence_ids":["v141-b-g01-E006","v141-b-g01-E007"],"proposal_ids":[],"required_work":"Manually check the source, proposal attribution and uniqueness statement, maintaining the current unverified status until review is completed separately."}]},"rule_refs":["18-dlmp_analysis::v141-c-R006","18-dlmp_analysis::v141-c-R007","18-dlmp_analysis::v141-c-R008"],"unresolved_rule_refs":[],"node_ids":["KG31-66660a21725d3de3","KG31-67fb13a427efcc14","KG40-45833afd23977831"]});
